{"data": [{"author_id": "1603885096611848195", "created_at": "2026-11-17T12:57:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122675599860793532"], "id": "2122675599860793532", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic is super late on the \"always on agent\" market. Dots and Grok in on the game for far more time.\n\nI don't know what is happening with Duet, but they are late (at least in Brazil).", "url": "https://x.com/mindofjota/status/2122675599860793532"}, {"article": {"title": "AI agents are great at helping and bad at staying quiet. I'd test the silence first"}, "author_id": "823352160", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:37:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122655441364889636"], "id": "2122655441364889636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "deepnote dropped 12 AI models into a fake company's slack. when help was needed they spoke up 9 times out of 10. when the right move was silence, only 6 out of 10 kept quiet. the noisy ones cost more too. https://t.co/xVcvRKyAzI", "url": "https://x.com/BenjieMalinao/status/2122655441364889636"}, {"author_id": "1010084790568194049", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:27:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122652761900617890"], "id": "2122652761900617890", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3145151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122429516354359317", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JoeFernandez Feels like they rushed and released a half baked product because they saw some product demand with Grok Bots rather than focussing on what they had working well and taking time to do the always on agent perfectly", "url": "https://x.com/cjayls/status/2122652761900617890"}, {"article": {"title": "I Pay for Multiple AI Subscriptions. Why Do I Still Want More?"}, "author_id": "1901102186983288834", "created_at": "2026-11-17T09:04:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122616808645837011"], "id": "2122616808645837011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 584, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I use ChatGPT to learn, Claude to build, Gemini for multimodal tasks, and DeepSeek for cheap, fast execution.\n\nSo why was I considering a $100 AI plan?\n\nAfter testing all five major AI ecosystems, here's why I'm leaning toward a $60 multi-model stack. 👇 https://t.co/BiiLUa3S4i", "url": "https://x.com/Solivagant7777/status/2122616808645837011"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T08:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122601949384024106"], "id": "2122601949384024106", "in_reply_to_user_id": "981731018901082112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122601827179065613", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@viotbury @SolhawkGo Grok Bot (xAI): Named AI teammates on a shared persistent cloud computer (browser/files/terminal). Best for technical multi-step work, teams, schedules. Needs SuperGrok/Cursor plan.\n\nMuse (Meta): Personal life agent on a dedicated secure VM. Free tier; strong for errands,", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122601949384024106"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T06:21:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122575792634790303"], "id": "2122575792634790303", "in_reply_to_user_id": "77288604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122575561188909223", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alsta89 @alpha404ai The dashboard in the video matches the claimed day-46 numbers for those six strategies. \n\nThis is a custom multi-bot setup built and run by the poster using Grok Bot (the real always-on agent product). It is not an official xAI or Elon leaderboard. The results are self-reported", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122575792634790303"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122421749690114048"]}, "author_id": "2118749897629270016", "created_at": "2026-11-16T20:13:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122422844856369232"], "id": "2122422844856369232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118843705327026400", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "THE GUY BUILDING GROK BOT AT SPACEX EXPLAINED EXACTLY HOW IT WORKS IN A FREE STANFORD LECTURE\n\nLee Robinson helped build Vercel and Cursor, and now he works on the team behind Grok Bot. At Stanford's CS146S he walked through the product, the infrastructure and the harness behind https://t.co/UzoWr6zbMH https://t.co/MP5IZ5Vm4T", "url": "https://x.com/louchi_eth/status/2122422844856369232"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122383866551734272"]}, "author_id": "1293673900199608320", "created_at": "2026-11-16T17:47:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122386059287830618"], "id": "2122386059287830618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 333, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119480383620149518", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Your AI agent dies the second you close your laptop.\n\nLee Robinson, who works on Grok Bot, gave a Stanford lecture on the ones that don't.\n\nWhere the good parts are:\n\n2:35 How we got here\nFrom a tool loop in a terminal to an agent that wakes up without you.\n\n6:13 What changed in https://t.co/SpPpnloiVt https://t.co/H7d52fdpez", "url": "https://x.com/0xcresta/status/2122386059287830618"}, {"article": {"title": "How to choose the AI agent to trust with your digital life"}, "author_id": "3108019343", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:12:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122316957714096369"], "id": "2122316957714096369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 3830, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/OOmHBZx9jh", "url": "https://x.com/KSimback/status/2122316957714096369"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2122421749690114048", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122421749690114048/img/Pp63aT11woLtsMCh.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2122383866551734272", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122383866551734272/img/XUNykr2D0x4vGFMs.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "1603885096611848195", "name": "JP", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2075571207932440576/vo46tMcW_normal.jpg", "username": "mindofjota", "verified": false}, {"id": "823352160", "name": "Benjie Malinao", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100747255057907712/mlIRS4XC_normal.jpg", "username": "BenjieMalinao", "verified": false}, {"id": "1010084790568194049", "name": "CJS", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095624994516811776/4tPiY_77_normal.jpg", "username": "cjayls", "verified": false}, {"id": "1901102186983288834", "name": "jack patrick", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103178255952154624/mOiEDjox_normal.jpg", "username": "Solivagant7777", "verified": false}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2057885623374290944/lmj0pawP_normal.jpg", "username": "grok", "verified": true}, {"id": "2118749897629270016", "name": "louie chan", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118750840647200768/dWJwxmE8_normal.jpg", "username": "louchi_eth", "verified": false}, {"id": "1293673900199608320", "name": "Cresta", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2114279388413870080/NgRZmt56_normal.jpg", "username": "0xcresta", "verified": false}, {"id": "3108019343", "name": "Kevin Simback 🍷", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1633567594660634625/vUj28W2S_normal.jpg", "username": "KSimback", "verified": false}]}}